### Folder Structure - Feature-Based Architecture
```
src/
├── routes/           # Page components with TanStack Router
├── components/
│   └── ui/          # Shadcn components
├── features/        # Feature-based modules
│   └── [feature-name]/
│       ├── components/  # Reusable UI components (extract when needed)
│       ├── containers/  # Entry points with business logic + UI rendering
│       ├── services.ts  # Business logic, API calls, and Jotai atoms
│       ├── types.ts     # TypeScript type definitions
│       └── index.ts     # Feature exports
│   └── locales/     # i18n translations feature (optional)
│       ├── components/  # Language selector, locale switcher components
│       ├── containers/  # Locale management containers
│       ├── services.ts  # Locale state management and i18n setup
│       ├── types.ts     # Locale-related types
│       ├── languages/     # Translation files (JSON)
│       │   ├── en.json
│       │   ├── es.json
│       │   └── ...
│       └── index.ts     # Locale feature exports
├── utils/           # Utility functions
└── assets/          # Static assets (images, JS)
```

**Export feature modules through index files**
   ```typescript
